<section class="section source-box"><p class="eyebrow">BIOLOGICAL ORIGIN / COMPUTING IMPLEMENTATION</p><h2>THE CALCIUM AND ZINC BLUEPRINT</h2>
<p>The calcium signal, zinc efflux, polyspermy block, and cell-cycle resumption are real biological phenomena. The “zinc spark” is detected by fluorescence microscopy using zinc-binding probes. In this app, they are implemented as software lifecycle stage names; the app does not produce sentience, biological reproduction, impenetrable security or uncontrolled autonomous evolution.</p>
